    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You, the protagonist, are plunged into a haunting scenario where your wits and reflexes are your only tools for survival. An invisible ghost stalks your every move, and the only weapon in your arsenal is an old-school Polaroid camera. With no vision of your adversary, your survival hinges on following directional instructions. Do you trust your instincts, or will doubt cloud your judgment?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The camera is your lifeline\u2014a fleeting glimpse into the unseen. Snap a photo, and for just a moment, the ghost\u2019s presence is revealed, frozen in the light of the Polaroid's flash. But be warned, your enemy is relentless.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you remain calm under pressure? When the tension mounts and the directions blur in your mind, the simplest question becomes the hardest to answer: Can you tell your left from your right? Are you going to continue waiting? Or are you ready to face it?&quot;</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You, the protagonist, are plunged into a haunting scenario where your wits and reflexes are your only tools for survival. An invisible ghost stalks your every move, and the only weapon in your arsenal is an old-school Polaroid camera. With no vision of your adversary, your survival hinges on following directional instructions. Do you trust your instincts, or will doubt cloud your judgment?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The camera is your lifeline\u2014a fleeting glimpse into the unseen. Snap a photo, and for just a moment, the ghost\u2019s presence is revealed, frozen in the light of the Polaroid's flash. But be warned, your enemy is relentless.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you remain calm under pressure? When the tension mounts and the directions blur in your mind, the simplest question becomes the hardest to answer: Can you tell your left from your right? Are you going to continue waiting? Or are you ready to face it?&quot;</p>",
